Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:12.87,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(100,100)}人生神秘莫測
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:14.28,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(100,100)}享受便是勝利
