Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.25,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&EB9277&\blur3\fad(100,100)}沉迷其中無視外界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:26.99,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&EB9277&\blur3\fad(100,100)}世界如此不公 那便將其顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:28.87,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}循環無休無止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.87,0:02:30.32,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}勝率一半一半
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.11,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}不願知曉未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:33.53,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}劇情陣陣刺痛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.32,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}無懼前功盡棄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:36.70,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}無畏翻滾墜落
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.51,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}捨棄安逸平穩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:39.90,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\3c&6464EB&\blur3\fad(100,100)}就此開始遊戲
